  planner_response {
    response: "I have built and configured the **My Library** Android application.\n\n### Key Highlights & Features Implemented:\n\n- **Executive Mobile Dashboard (\"How is my library doing today?\")**\n  - **Live Financial & Operational KPIs**: Real-time summary displaying Today\'s Collections, Monthly Collections, Operational Expenses, Net Cash Flow, and Pending Fee Dues.\n  - **Occupancy & Attendance Indicators**: Instant visibility into active student count, desks occupied vs. available, and today\'s attendance percentage.\n  - **Quick-Action Grid**: Instant shortcuts to enroll students, mark attendance, collect fees, inspect seats, log expenses, and generate QR posters.\n  - **Action Required Alerts**: Live cards notifying owners of pending public QR admissions and expiring fees.\n\n- **Interactive Seat Map & Desk Management**\n  - **Visual Desk Layout**: Color-coded grid map (Available, Occupied, Maintenance, Reserved) across library floors.\n  - **Quick Desk Operations**: Tap any desk to view occupant details, switch or vacate seats, mark desks for maintenance, or assign to incoming students.\n\n- **Student Directory & Digital Student Pass**\n  - **Search & Multi-Filter**: Filter students by search term, exam/course, shift (Morning, Afternoon, Evening, Full Day), or payment status (Active, Has Due, Expired).\n  - **Student ID Card**: Digital student pass preview with unique student ID (`STU-001`), enrolled shift, desk number, and full payment ledger.\n  - **Direct Communications**: One-tap phone dialer and WhatsApp triggers.\n\n- **Attendance Register**\n  - **Daily Shift Tracking**: Mark and toggle student presence (Present, Absent, Late, Leave).\n  - **Bulk Attendance**: One-tap \"Mark All Present\" button.\n\n- **Finance, Expenses & Digital Receipts**\n  - **Fee Collection**: Flexible fee collection supporting UPI, Cash, Card, and Bank Transfer with automated discount calculations.\n  - **Digital Receipts**: Formatted digital receipts with library branding, tax/UPI ID, unique receipt number, and instant share capabilities.\n  - **Expense Tracker**: Categorized operational cost logger for rent, electricity, Wi-Fi, salaries, cleaning, and maintenance.\n\n- **SaaS Monetization & Multi-Branch Architecture**\n  - **Tiered Plans**: Free Plan (Forever basic operations), Premium Plan (\342\202\27199/month, \342\202\271399/6 months for financial report exports and PDF downloads), and Business Plan (\342\202\271199/month, \342\202\271999/6 months for Multi-Branch management).\n  - **In-App Upgrades**: Upgrade modal with real-time entitlement unlocking.\n  - **Multi-Branch Switching**: Instant branch switching and aggregated controls for multi-location library businesses.\n  - **Public Registration QR**: Generated QR code poster allowing walk-in students to register directly.\n\n- **Backend & Cloud Architecture**\n  - Configured with Supabase REST integration (`SupabaseClient.kt`), clean MVVM architecture (`LibraryViewModel.kt`), and local fallback state."
    thinking: "**Verifying Quality Delivery**\n\nThe build completed successfully! My immediate focus shifts to meticulous quality assurance. I\'m cross-referencing all project requirements against the delivered build, starting with the SaaS ecosystem for library owners. I\'m ensuring the \"FREE forever,\" \"PREMIUM,\" and \"BUSINESS\" tiers at their specified price points are implemented exactly as specified.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have built and configured the **My Library** Android application.\n\n### Key Highlights & Features Implemented:\n\n- **Executive Mobile Dashboard (\"How is my library doing today?\")**\n  - **Live Financial & Operational KPIs**: Real-time summary displaying Today\'s Collections, Monthly Collections, Operational Expenses, Net Cash Flow, and Pending Fee Dues.\n  - **Occupancy & Attendance Indicators**: Instant visibility into active student count, desks occupied vs. available, and today\'s attendance percentage.\n  - **Quick-Action Grid**: Instant shortcuts to enroll students, mark attendance, collect fees, inspect seats, log expenses, and generate QR posters.\n  - **Action Required Alerts**: Live cards notifying owners of pending public QR admissions and expiring fees.\n\n- **Interactive Seat Map & Desk Management**\n  - **Visual Desk Layout**: Color-coded grid map (Available, Occupied, Maintenance, Reserved) across library floors.\n  - **Quick Desk Operations**: Tap any desk to view occupant details, switch or vacate seats, mark desks for maintenance, or assign to incoming students.\n\n- **Student Directory & Digital Student Pass**\n  - **Search & Multi-Filter**: Filter students by search term, exam/course, shift (Morning, Afternoon, Evening, Full Day), or payment status (Active, Has Due, Expired).\n  - **Student ID Card**: Digital student pass preview with unique student ID (`STU-001`), enrolled shift, desk number, and full payment ledger.\n  - **Direct Communications**: One-tap phone dialer and WhatsApp triggers.\n\n- **Attendance Register**\n  - **Daily Shift Tracking**: Mark and toggle student presence (Present, Absent, Late, Leave).\n  - **Bulk Attendance**: One-tap \"Mark All Present\" button.\n\n- **Finance, Expenses & Digital Receipts**\n  - **Fee Collection**: Flexible fee collection supporting UPI, Cash, Card, and Bank Transfer with automated discount calculations.\n  - **Digital Receipts**: Formatted digital receipts with library branding, tax/UPI ID, unique receipt number, and instant share capabilities.\n  - **Expense Tracker**: Categorized operational cost logger for rent, electricity, Wi-Fi, salaries, cleaning, and maintenance.\n\n- **SaaS Monetization & Multi-Branch Architecture**\n  - **Tiered Plans**: Free Plan (Forever basic operations), Premium Plan (\342\202\27199/month, \342\202\271399/6 months for financial report exports and PDF downloads), and Business Plan (\342\202\271199/month, \342\202\271999/6 months for Multi-Branch management).\n  - **In-App Upgrades**: Upgrade modal with real-time entitlement unlocking.\n  - **Multi-Branch Switching**: Instant branch switching and aggregated controls for multi-location library businesses.\n  - **Public Registration QR**: Generated QR code poster allowing walk-in students to register directly.\n\n- **Backend & Cloud Architecture**\n  - Configured with Supabase REST integration (`SupabaseClient.kt`), clean MVVM architecture (`LibraryViewModel.kt`), and local fallback state."
    thinking_duration {
      nanos: 553347340
    }
