  planner_response {
    response: "I have implemented the requested fixes and updates:\n\n- **Dashboard Quick Actions & Navigation**:\n  - **Clickable Students & Expenses Actions**: Added distinct, interactive **Students** (navigates to the full Students registry) and **Expenses** (navigates directly to the Expenses ledger tab) Quick Action cards, alongside the dedicated **+ Student** and **+ Expense** creation modals.\n  - **Hero & KPI Interactivity**: Enabled direct click navigation from the Hero financial banner (\"Expenses\", \"Pending Dues\") and KPI status cards directly to their corresponding management screens.\n  - **Global Modal Controller**: Hosted modal dialogs (`AddStudentDialog`, `AddExpenseDialog`, `CollectFeeDialog`, `StudentDetailDialog`, `ReceiptDialog`, etc.) at the root application level so all Quick Action triggers from the Home dashboard open immediately and seamlessly.\n\n- **Attendance Simplification & Date Controls**:\n  - **Simplified Statuses**: Removed the \"Late\" and \"Leave\" options, leaving clear **Present** and **Absent** toggle actions.\n  - **Date Picker & History Navigation**: Integrated calendar date selection and day-by-day navigation to inspect historical attendance for any date.\n  - **3-Day Editability Enforcement**: Attendance editing is enabled for today, yesterday, and the day before yesterday; all records older than 2 days ago are locked into a read-only state."
    thinking: "**Verifying Requirements Achieved**\n\nI\'ve confirmed the build\'s success! Now I\'m carefully double-checking the user\'s specific requirements. I\'ve addressed the navigation issue on the home page. Interactive Quick Action cards are now in place for \"Students,\" directing to the Students tab, and also for \"+ Student,\". This should satisfy the core request regarding accessibility.\n\n\n"
