  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Exploring Authentication Integration**\n\nOkay, I\'m currently focused on seamless authentication integration. In `LibraryRepository.kt`, I\'m looking at adding a `MutableStateFlow` for login status. I\'m thinking of creating a function to handle logins. Further, I am considering other methods for authentication, but am waiting on more information before implementation.\n\n\n**Implementing Authentication Methods**\n\nI\'ve fleshed out the authentication methods. I\'m adding `login`, `logout`, and `register` functions within `LibraryRepository.kt`, managing login status using a `MutableStateFlow` and logging audit entries. Corresponding functions in `LibraryViewModel.kt` will expose the login status and call the repository\'s methods, triggering toasts for logout success. Next, I\'ll be designing a modern, orange-and-white aesthetic login screen, including a hero banner and login options.\n\n\n**Designing Login & Settings**\n\nI\'m now designing the login screen. It will include clean mobile/email and password/PIN/OTP fields, a quick access button (\"Sign In as Ratnesh Ankit\"), and a registration option. Secure Material 3 design is the goal, with proper touch targets and icons. For the main activity, I\'ll direct users to the appropriate screens (Login, Onboarding, or Main App) based on login and onboarding status. Settings will include a prominent \"Log Out\" item with a confirmation dialog. I am also considering quick profile edit or account switch.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
