    thinking: "**Analyzing UI Requirements**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the UI requirements within `LoginScreen.kt`, specifically examining the user\'s login and registration flow for new users of the library. My analysis indicates a clear need for easily accessible login and registration options upon app launch, directly addressing the user\'s initial interaction. The system must support the new user flow.\n\n\n**Designing Registration Form**\n\nNow, I\'m fleshing out the registration form within `LoginScreen.kt`. It will have three distinct sections: personal details (name, phone, email, password), library details (name, contact, address, capacity, shift details), followed by a \"Sign In\" with phone number and optional password/OTP login. The UI will have a welcoming \"Library Space\" branded header with logo. I also have added dual tab bar for Sign in and Register new Library, and friendly banner.\n\n\n"
