  planner_response {
    response: "I have completed the updated **Login & Multi-Section Registration** flow for your library management app:\n\n### 1. New User Registration Flow (3 Structured Sections)\n- **Section 1: Personal Details**\n  - Owner Full Name, Phone Number, WhatsApp Number (with a 1-tap *\"Same as Phone\"* checkbox), Email Address, Password & Confirm Password (with real-time confirmation validation).\n- **Section 2: Library Details**\n  - Library / Study Center Name, Contact Number (with *\"Same as Owner Phone\"* option), Official Email (with *\"Same as Owner Email\"* option), Complete Physical Address, Location / Landmark & City, and Seats Capacity selector (presets for 40, 60, 80, 100, 150 seats, or custom count input).\n- **Section 3: Library Shift Details**\n  - Interactive shift toggle cards for **Morning Shift** (06:00 AM \342\200\223 12:00 PM | \342\202\271600/mo), **Afternoon Shift** (12:00 PM \342\200\223 05:00 PM | \342\202\271550/mo), **Evening Shift** (05:00 PM \342\200\223 11:00 PM | \342\202\271650/mo), **Full Day 24x7** (06:00 AM \342\200\223 11:00 PM | \342\202\2711,200/mo), and **Night Owl Shift** (09:00 PM \342\200\223 06:00 AM | \342\202\271700/mo).\n  - Configures and dynamically initializes the seat map layout matching the custom capacity upon completing registration.\n\n### 2. Existing User Login Flow\n- **Dual Authentication Modes**:\n  - **Password Login**: Phone number / Email entry with password visibility toggle.\n  - **OTP Login**: Enter phone number, tap *\"Get Verification OTP\"*, instant simulated SMS notification banner with an *\"Auto-fill\"* helper, 4-digit code entry, and *\"Resend Code\"* option.\n- **One-Tap Demo Access**: Instant quick login button into the pre-populated demo library dashboard for instant testing."
    modified_response: "I have completed the updated **Login & Multi-Section Registration** flow for your library management app:\n\n### 1. New User Registration Flow (3 Structured Sections)\n- **Section 1: Personal Details**\n  - Owner Full Name, Phone Number, WhatsApp Number (with a 1-tap *\"Same as Phone\"* checkbox), Email Address, Password & Confirm Password (with real-time confirmation validation).\n- **Section 2: Library Details**\n  - Library / Study Center Name, Contact Number (with *\"Same as Owner Phone\"* option), Official Email (with *\"Same as Owner Email\"* option), Complete Physical Address, Location / Landmark & City, and Seats Capacity selector (presets for 40, 60, 80, 100, 150 seats, or custom count input).\n- **Section 3: Library Shift Details**\n  - Interactive shift toggle cards for **Morning Shift** (06:00 AM \342\200\223 12:00 PM | \342\202\271600/mo), **Afternoon Shift** (12:00 PM \342\200\223 05:00 PM | \342\202\271550/mo), **Evening Shift** (05:00 PM \342\200\223 11:00 PM | \342\202\271650/mo), **Full Day 24x7** (06:00 AM \342\200\223 11:00 PM | \342\202\2711,200/mo), and **Night Owl Shift** (09:00 PM \342\200\223 06:00 AM | \342\202\271700/mo).\n  - Configures and dynamically initializes the seat map layout matching the custom capacity upon completing registration.\n\n### 2. Existing User Login Flow\n- **Dual Authentication Modes**:\n  - **Password Login**: Phone number / Email entry with password visibility toggle.\n  - **OTP Login**: Enter phone number, tap *\"Get Verification OTP\"*, instant simulated SMS notification banner with an *\"Auto-fill\"* helper, 4-digit code entry, and *\"Resend Code\"* option.\n- **One-Tap Demo Access**: Instant quick login button into the pre-populated demo library dashboard for instant testing."
