    thinking: "**Defining Theme Components**\n\nI\'ve been working on defining some reusable theming components in `Theme.kt`, specifically focusing on `OutlinedTextField` colors. I\'m exploring a helper function to manage the colors consistently and cleanly. I\'m considering using `InputTextBlack` and other color constants directly within this function, ensuring a unified visual style. I\'m aiming for a concise and easily maintainable approach.\n\n\n**Implementing Color Palette**\n\nI\'ve fleshed out the color palette further, defining focused and unfocused states for various `OutlinedTextField` elements like text, container, border, label, placeholder, and icons. I\'ve also incorporated the `AppInputTextStyle` using `InputTextBlack` to ensure text consistency. Now, I\'m integrating these color definitions into `Theme.kt`, aiming for a single source of truth for all color-related theming, and updating `LightColorScheme` to match.\n\n\n"
