  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining the WhatsApp System**\n\nI\'m currently focused on defining the WhatsApp fee reminder system\'s core. I\'ve started by reviewing the basic requirements, specifically the plan gating, and the initial observation is that a Free plan is the right starting point for this system. I am keeping in mind the user need for high utility and intuitiveness.\n\n\n**Refining the Plan Structure**\n\nI\'ve been drilling down into the plan specifics. The system will leverage a clear gating mechanism: the core functionality unlocks with the Premium and Business plans. This approach aligns with the need to provide immediate value and incentivizes users to upgrade. I\'m focusing now on the user experience of the upgrade flow, making sure it\'s intuitive and efficient.\n\n\n**Developing Reminder Triggers**\n\nI\'m now diving into the implementation of automated triggers. I am designing alerts for both the owner and the student. I\'ve built in customizable templates and automated reminders. The system will detect due students and trigger messages. I\'m simulating cron jobs, to test the timing of these alerts. I\'m designing toggle switches for alert frequency and customizing messages.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 2
      nanos: 567936216
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
