  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Fee Due Dates**\n\nI\'m thinking we need to add a `feeDueDate: String` field to the `Student` data class, so we know when tuition is due. The due dates would be formatted like \"2026-08-28\". I am updating `Models.kt`.\n\n\n**Adding WhatsApp Functionality**\n\nI\'m now thinking about adding a `WhatsAppFeeReminder` data class to `Models.kt` to handle automated WhatsApp alerts and reminders. This would include fields for student ID, due amount, due date, and a timestamp, and I am considering recipient types. I think I will add status to the reminder object.\n\n\n**Defining Feature Scope**\n\nI\'m now determining how to integrate WhatsApp fee reminders with the current SaaS plans. I\'ve defined feature availability based on `SaaSPlanType`. I will be updating `UpgradeModal.kt` to clearly indicate feature inclusions for each plan, specifically highlighting WhatsApp fee reminder features with lock icons for the free plan. I\'m also planning the Owner WhatsApp Fee Due Notification System, aiming to generate structured alerts for fee dues.\n\n\n**Generating Fee Notifications**\n\nI\'ve been working on generating automated fee due notifications. I\'m now drafting the content for WhatsApp reminders, including details like student name, due amount, due date, library name, and contact information. I\'m considering structuring these messages for clarity and ease of payment. I am working on the function `generateStudentWhatsAppDueReminderText(student, library)`.\n\n\n**Refining Notification Content**\n\nI\'ve finalized the WhatsApp reminder content format, incorporating key details like assigned seat, due amount, and payment options. I\'m focusing on providing clear instructions and contact information, including UPI details and library phone numbers. I am adding a thank you, and library information, to each message.\n\n\n**Integrating WhatsApp Actions**\n\nI\'m now integrating WhatsApp actions into the dashboard and student screen components. I\'m focusing on actionable cards in `DashboardScreen.kt`, and adding a WhatsApp reminder icon to `StudentCard`, only if the student has outstanding dues. These new components will have prominent visual cues, and will launch WhatsApp directly with preformatted text containing all relevant due details.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 5
      nanos: 314528657
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
