  planner_response {
    response: "I have resolved the issue so that newly registered libraries start with a completely fresh, clean workspace, and logging into existing accounts restores all previously saved data.\n\n### Key Changes Implemented\n\n- **Clean & Fresh New Library Registration**:\n  - When registering a new library, the workspace initializes **100% clean and fresh**:\n    - **Zero Students** (`0` enrolled students instead of pre-filled mock students)\n    - **Zero Payments & Zero Expenses** (`\342\202\2710` collections and expenses)\n    - **Clean Seat Grid**: All seats generated for the selected capacity are marked as **Available** with no pre-assigned or dummy students.\n    - **Zero Attendance & Zero Requests**: Fresh attendance log and request queue.\n  - Registration fields start blank and validate required information before launching.\n\n- **Persistent Multi-Account Storage & Login**:\n  - Integrated local account persistence via `LibraryAccountStorage` tied to the application lifecycle.\n  - **Auto-Persistence**: Every student enrolled, fee collected, expense logged, seat assigned, attendance marked, or library detail updated is continuously saved for the active account.\n  - **Account Restoration on Login**: Logging in with your registered phone number or email and password restores all your previously saved students, payments, expenses, and seat maps.\n  - **Demo Account Separation**: Kept the sample library data isolated under the Demo Account (`+91 9876543210`), ensuring it does not overwrite or mix with new custom library registrations."
    modified_response: "I have resolved the issue so that newly registered libraries start with a completely fresh, clean workspace, and logging into existing accounts restores all previously saved data.\n\n### Key Changes Implemented\n\n- **Clean & Fresh New Library Registration**:\n  - When registering a new library, the workspace initializes **100% clean and fresh**:\n    - **Zero Students** (`0` enrolled students instead of pre-filled mock students)\n    - **Zero Payments & Zero Expenses** (`\342\202\2710` collections and expenses)\n    - **Clean Seat Grid**: All seats generated for the selected capacity are marked as **Available** with no pre-assigned or dummy students.\n    - **Zero Attendance & Zero Requests**: Fresh attendance log and request queue.\n  - Registration fields start blank and validate required information before launching.\n\n- **Persistent Multi-Account Storage & Login**:\n  - Integrated local account persistence via `LibraryAccountStorage` tied to the application lifecycle.\n  - **Auto-Persistence**: Every student enrolled, fee collected, expense logged, seat assigned, attendance marked, or library detail updated is continuously saved for the active account.\n  - **Account Restoration on Login**: Logging in with your registered phone number or email and password restores all your previously saved students, payments, expenses, and seat maps.\n  - **Demo Account Separation**: Kept the sample library data isolated under the Demo Account (`+91 9876543210`), ensuring it does not overwrite or mix with new custom library registrations."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
